{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50160","headline":"宴卢十四南园得园韵（伯三七七一下同） · 元希声","name":"宴卢十四南园得园韵（伯三七七一下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"超遥乘暇景，洒散绝浮喧。\n写望峯云出，开襟夏木繁。\n野人怜狎鸟，游子爱芳荪。\n卧筱低临席，惊流注满园。\n□然林下意，琴酌坐忘言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}